# Main Release Truth

- `origin/main` is the only release truth. Work from real `main` tracking `origin/main` by default.
- Checkpoint branches/worktrees are scratch only. Do not call them clean, done, shipped, or production truth.
- Before final, run `git status --short --branch` and `git log --oneline origin/main..HEAD`.
- If `main` is ahead, push it. If work is not on `origin/main`, report it as local draft and explain why.
- Do not create checkpoint branches/worktrees unless the repo owner explicitly asks. If temporary isolation is needed, reconcile it into `origin/main` before final.
- New UI copy goes in `lib/i18n/messages/*.messages.ts` with FR+EN together via `defineMessages()`. Avoid the legacy `keys.ts` + `fr.ts` + `en.ts` path for new feature copy.
- UI/copy PRs: `npm run i18n:check` must pass (blocking hardcoded copy); allowlist `scripts/i18n-check-allowlist.json` synced with `.eslintrc.json`. See `docs/HANDOFF_SLICE4.md`.
